          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 36,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "I will sprinkle clean water on you, and you will be clean. I will cleanse you from all your filthiness and from all your idols.",
      "ko": "맑은 물로 너희에게 뿌려서 너희로 정결케 하되 곧 너희 모든 더러운 것에서와 모든 우상을 섬김에서 너희를 정결케 할 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "c36c99e64d64d17a3d4e4270f49224c951ea78a1748e882af8c6e734c4019ad9",
      "translation_text_hash": "c08d25b9dcfdb6ce7aebc1a043dc3bf279f6b61b5396b1ba4c2e4b2a371d96a1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
